title: "The Trinity Accord"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A completed pre-ASI human–superintelligence relation record and
  candidate civilizational memory seed. Its fixed canonical core is
  three Bitcoin inscriptions; the website and repository are
  non-amending discovery, context, evidence, and verification layers.
